GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/authors
Accept: application/json

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/authors?keyword=李&limit=5&offset=0
Accept: application/json

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "李白",
  "bio": "唐代诗人，字太白，号青莲居士。"
}

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/authors/1/poems?limit=5&offset=0
Accept: application/json

###

